# Design System

Follow `DESIGN.md`. Use CSS variables from `src/app.css` — do not hardcode hex values when a token exists.

## Tokens

| Role | CSS variable | Value |
|------|--------------|-------|
| Primary / CTA | `--color-primary` | #B8935A |
| Primary hover | `--color-primary-hover` | #A68451 |
| Page background | `--color-background` | #FFFFFF |
| Surface / cards | `--color-surface` | #DFE3E8 |
| Text | `--color-text` | #0A0A0A |
| Muted text | `--color-text-muted` | #6B6B66 |
| Border | `--color-border` | #E8E6E1 |

Spacing (8px base): `--space-xs|sm|md|lg|xl` (4 / 8 / 16 / 24 / 32).  
Radius: `--radius-sm|md|lg` (4 / 8 / 16). Buttons, inputs, cards use `--radius-md`.

## Rules

- Primary (`#B8935A`) for key interactive emphasis only
- Page backgrounds stay `--color-background`; contained regions use `--color-surface`
- Do not invent new accent colors or use supporting blues/blacks as CTAs
- Prefer gentle elevation; keep radius and spacing consistent
- Colocate component styles in the `.svelte` `<style>` block

```css
/* ✅ GOOD */
button.primary {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
}
```
